CORE
main.sh
--shell-strings refined
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[assertion\.1\] .* 0 = 1: SUCCESS$
^\[assertion\.2\] .* 0 = 2: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Two pattern matches on concatenations that share their parts: the index
terms of the string solver move along the cycle of concatenations without
reaching the positions where the models violate the axioms, so that the
refinement did not finish in 300 s. The solver now also adds the
counter-examples of not_contains axioms in each round, which exclude those
models.
